# Local scratch and dev artefacts. Nothing under .artifacts/ is tracked; it holds the
# guided-reading image factory (~174MB), story-quest backups and proof sheets, and
# whatever else a tool drops. Ignoring the whole directory so `git add -A` cannot
# sweep it into a commit. (2026-07-26)
.artifacts/

