# Obsidian vault. The vault is rooted at the repo so its config travels with the
# branch (added 2026-07-27). Shared: app.json (exclusion filters), core-plugins.json.
# Not shared: workspace layout and per-person UI state.
.obsidian/workspace.json
.obsidian/workspace-mobile.json
.obsidian/graph.json
.obsidian/hotkeys.json

# Design-handoff prototype art. link-assets.sh symlinks every referenced file to
# its repo original under public/ (all verified byte-identical 2026-07-29), so
# the bundle runs offline without a second copy of 27MB in git. Symlinks would
# be worse than copies here — they break on checkout for anyone whose paths
# differ. Run mockups/design-handoff-kids-side/link-assets.sh to rebuild.
mockups/design-handoff-kids-side/assets/
